@startuml state-reservation
' Supporting state machine: Reservation
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state Waiting
state "Ready for pickup" as Ready
state Fulfilled
state Expired
state Cancelled

[*] --> Waiting : place reservation\n[FR-13]
Waiting --> Ready : first in queue and a copy is returned,\nadded, or passed on from an expired hold\n/ copy On hold, pickupDeadline = today + 3 days\n[FR-14, FR-04 AC3, FR-15 AC2]
Ready --> Fulfilled : member borrows the held copy\n[FR-09 AC6, FR-14 AC2]
Ready --> Expired : today > pickupDeadline\n[FR-15]
Waiting --> Cancelled : cancel\n[FR-16]
Ready --> Cancelled : cancel / held copy passed on\n[FR-16]

Fulfilled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
